model g8_point_by_id
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.2 (issue #32), G8: L §5.14.1, E §4.1: read at a point of the walk on day t, a projection counts only the movements not yet booked. sw and sw_b are decisions of one stratum on 2026-01-10 (sw reads konto, sw_b reads savings; neither changes what the other reads), so sw runs first, by move id. sw_b's leg runs between places its defs give, each refused (RUN-DIV), so its refusal holds for every place; sw's projection at its point counts sw_b's act, so sw's amount is refused, and its flows with it (q), and so are sw_b's (u); a balance before the day stands (r). The twin g8/point_by_id_twin divides by one: q is 99.00 PLN. tally 2.1.1's refcore compared the point sw|000000 with sw_b as one text (_ sorts before |), left sw_b's act out and printed q: 99.00 PLN here. The amounts are read as flows of the moves: S builds no read of a leg's fields."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind pots: place PLN signed

kind sinks: place PLN signed outside

input day: date

input zero: int

input ahead: int

input amt: money PLN

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place savings: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place pot: pots lives 2026-01-01..

place sink: sinks lives 1900-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

def src: key pots = if zero / zero > 0 then pot else pot

def snk: key sinks = if zero / zero > 0 then sink else sink

move sw: transfers
  on day
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to world amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto, add_days(day, ahead)) from day - amt)

move sw_b: transfers
  on day
  reads savings
  leg cash from src to snk amount amt + 0 * bal(savings)

ask q: flows(sw, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31)

ask r: bal(konto, 2026-01-09)

ask u: flows(sw_b, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31)

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  day = 2026-01-10
  zero = 0
  ahead = 5
  amt = 1.00 PLN
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[savings] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[pot] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
